1
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,680
You two murderers,

2
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,560
I gave you the identity of Lin Jiming

3
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,240
and everything that comes with it.

4
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,440
Wake up

5
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:52,240
and be a good heir to the Lin family.

6
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,440
Don't go crazy here.

7
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,400
What?

8
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:56,760
Not happy?

9
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:58,520
Then you'd better have the guts

10
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,520
to take away what's most important to me now.

11
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:02,640
Can you do that?

12
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:04,360
Dear son,

13
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:05,680
who do you think you are?

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,360
The heir to the Lin Group?

15
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,000
The biological son of Lin Muyun?

16
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:09,840
You're not.

17
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,640
You are the child of Wu Zhanshan.

18
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,440
You are the child of your mother, Wen Shiyi,

19
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:16,400
and his distant cousin, Wu Zhanshan.

20
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,080
Mr. Lin,

21
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,280
you can't be discharged yet.

22
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:41,320
Mr. Lin.

23
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:42,600
Mr. Lin.

24
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,160
Xintian!

25
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:08,400
Xintian, open the door!

26
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:10,360
I know you're in there.

27
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:12,080
Can you hear me out?

28
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:13,680
Xintian!

29
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,600
Open the door!

30
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,680
I know you're in there!

31
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:17,680
Xintian.

32
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,360
Xintian.

33
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,360
Xintian, open the door.

34
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:23,880
There's nothing

35
00:02:24,640 --> 00:02:25,920
to explain between us.

36
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,840
Not even a little?

37
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,760
Not even a little?

38
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,520
There's only blood debt between us.

39
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:34,880
Goodbye, Mr. Lin.

40
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:36,880
Oh, no.

41
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,120
Mr. Wu.

42
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:54,600
Goodbye, Mr. Lin.

43
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:55,920
Oh, no.

44
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:58,240
Mr. Wu.

45
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,360
Who am I?

46
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,240
Wu Zhanshan's son,

47
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:03,160
Wen Shiyi's puppet,

48
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,480
or

49
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:07,440
the enemy

50
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,840
she wants to kill?

51
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,560
Mr. Wen,

52
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:22,600
don't worry.

53
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,880
I have already instructed Zhou Man.

54
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:26,600
She wouldn't dare to say anything.

55
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,200
Okay.

56
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,640
Got it.

57
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,200
Mr. Wen,

58
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,640
what's going on with Mr. Lin?

59
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:30,720
The company can't be leaderless.

60
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:32,080
The IPO is stalled.

61
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:33,440
We need a solution.

62
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,160
Yeah.

63
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:34,880
If this continues,

64
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:36,040
everyone's interests will be damaged.

65
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:50,360
Please calm down.

66
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,480
Listen to me.

67
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:56,120
I understand

68
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,160
your feelings.

69
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,800
First,

70
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,880
I have some sad news to tell you.

71
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,280
Our chairman,

72
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,240
the founder,

73
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,280
my husband, Mr. Lin Muyun

74
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:11,040
passed away

75
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,160
due to illness

76
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,360
the other day.

77
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,360
What?

78
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:16,600
How could this happen?

79
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,160
What's going on?

80
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,000
When did this happen?

81
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:29,960
Later,

82
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:32,120
a funeral committee will be set up

83
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:34,240
to arrange the funeral affairs of Chairman Lin.

84
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,120
As for Jiming,

85
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:41,640
he was greatly affected by his father's death.

86
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:43,440
At present,

87
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,280
his mental state

88
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,720
is extremely unstable.

89
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,320
He is unable to perform

90
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:49,880
any management duties.

91
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,240
Of course,

92
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,760
there are also

93
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,560
some people with ulterior motives

94
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:55,480
who are inciting

95
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:56,840
and bewitching him.

96
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:58,800
Just like the lawyer

97
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,960
he hired before,

98
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,360
whose background is unclear

99
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,560
and purpose is not pure.

100
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,760
He used his position

101
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:08,440
and improper means

102
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,480
to get close to Jiming,

103
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:12,040
disrupting the order of the company.

104
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,080
He even

105
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,400
sowed discord between us.

106
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:16,960
Jiming is young

107
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,440
and was temporarily deceived,

108
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:20,400
which led to today's situation.

109
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,720
As for this kind of person,

110
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:22,640
we Lin's Group

111
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:23,800
will never tolerate.

112
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:25,840
Mr. Wen,

113
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,760
I think your statement

114
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:28,800
is unfair.

115
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:40,720
Yaru,

116
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:43,280
this is not the place for you to speak.

117
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:48,040
Everyone,

118
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,960
during Guan's employment,

119
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:51,440
all the cases she handled

120
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:53,680
were done with neat and tidy.

121
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,000
She helped the company avoid huge risks

122
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,360
and potential losses.

123
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:59,840
Her professional ability and performance

124
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:01,200
are obvious to all of us.

125
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,600
To blame

126
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,800
Mr. Lin's personal emotions

127
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,400
on a dedicated and responsible

128
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:11,880
legal counsel who has already resigned,

129
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,240
I think

130
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,520
it's not only unfair,

131
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,600
but also

132
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,520
unconvincing.

133
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,120
Yaru,

134
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,080
please sit down.

135
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:26,080
Don't be childish.

136
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,200
Director Liu,

137
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:28,760
what we are discussing now

138
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,000
is the management

139
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,400
and responsibility of the company,

140
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,880
not a child's game.

141
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:33,960
Mr. Wen,

142
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:36,080
you mentioned ulterior motives

143
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,480
and improper means.

144
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:38,520
May I ask

145
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:40,240
if there is concrete evidence?

146
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:41,800
If not,

147
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,480
is it appropriate to publicly accuse

148
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:46,000
in such a setting?

149
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:55,680
Liu Yaru,

150
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:57,720
be mindful of your position.

151
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,200
Since

152
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:03,360
the company has invited me to attend this meeting,

153
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,280
I have the responsibility and obligation

154
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:07,520
to uphold the company's fairness and reputation.

155
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,080
I believe

156
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,360
the most important thing now

157
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,600
is to stabilize the situation

158
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,640
and solve the problem,

159
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,160
not

160
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,560
to find a scapegoat

161
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:17,520
and engage in personal attacks.

162
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:21,040
What we should be focusing on now

163
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:23,200
is how to get the company back on track,

164
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:25,480
not publicly accusing

165
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,960
someone who isn't even here.

166
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,760
That's all, everyone.

167
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,920
Given the current

168
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,360
emergency situation,

169
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,400
in accordance with the company's articles of association

170
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:56,160
and the relevant clauses of the shareholder agreement,

171
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,120
I propose

172
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:57,920
and have obtained

173
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:59,440
the joint support of

174
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,200
some major shareholders,

175
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:10,680
that effective immediately,

176
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,440
I, Wen Shiyi,

177
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:15,480
will serve as the acting Chairman and CEO of the Group,

178
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:17,280
until Mr. Lin Jiming

179
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,640
fully recovers,

180
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,800
or a more

181
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:20,800
suitable permanent

182
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:22,880
solution is found.

183
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:24,360
I agree.

184
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:26,320
Besides,

185
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:27,720
there's another thing.

186
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,800
It's about the future ownership

187
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:31,160
structure of the Lin Group.

188
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:36,720
Ladies and gentlemen,

189
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:37,760
this is

190
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:40,080
the will of Lin Muyun,

191
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:42,160
the founder of Lin Group,

192
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:42,960
signed

193
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:45,080
in the presence of

194
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,400
two independent lawyers

195
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:47,640
three years ago.

196
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,160
The will

197
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:51,400
stated that all the shares

198
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:52,760
of Lin Group

199
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,440
and

200
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:54,760
all personal movable and

201
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:55,560
immovable properties

202
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:56,800
unconditionally

203
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:57,960
to his wife,

204
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:58,960
that is,

205
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,400
Ms. Wen Shiyi.

206
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:05,200
So,

207
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,640
I will do my best

208
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,120
to lead Lin Group

209
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:09,360
out of difficulties

210
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,200
and return to its former glory.

211
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,520
Yaru

212
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:28,840
Yaru

213
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,000
What does Chairman Liu want to do?

214
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:34,120
How can you talk to your brother like that?

215
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,160
I haven't asked you yet.

216
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:37,440
Why did you suddenly come back?

217
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,800
Why can't I come back?

218
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:42,960
Tell me the truth.

219
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,440
Did you and Wen Shiyi

220
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:46,080
reach some agreement?

221
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:51,720
Yaru

222
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,800
You shouldn't have said that.

223
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:55,040
People who don't know the truth

224
00:11:55,040 --> 00:11:56,680
may think that I asked you to say that.

225
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,000
Fine.

226
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,440
From now on,

227
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:00,360
you are you,

228
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:01,040
and I am me.

229
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,280
What are you talking about?

230
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,400
Am I not your brother?

231
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:07,440
I just want to warn you.

232
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:08,800
Be careful of Wen Shiyi.

233
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,680
Don't drag our Liu family into this.

234
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:11,960
You...

235
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,000
Yaru

236
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:14,360
Yaru

237
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,520
Yaru

238
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:18,200
Let me explain.

239
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,160
Yaru

240
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:20,760
Yaru

241
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,200
Big news!

242
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,240
Shareholders' meeting.

243
00:12:38,520 --> 00:12:39,040
She...

244
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,200
Have some water and take your time.

245
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:45,280
What's going on?

246
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:46,880
Wen Shiyi

247
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,320
launched a surprise attack.

248
00:12:48,400 --> 00:12:49,480
Lin Muyun passed away,

249
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:51,880
and Lin Jiming is mentally unstable and unable to fulfill his duties.

250
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:53,360
Now she's temporarily

251
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,280
taking over as chairman

252
00:12:54,280 --> 00:12:55,840
and CEO of the Lin Group.

253
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:57,280
Lin Muyun passed away?

254
00:12:58,880 --> 00:12:59,320
Yes.

255
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:01,240
And there's more.

256
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:01,640
She

257
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:03,600
presented a will

258
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:04,840
at the shareholders' meeting.

259
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:06,320
It's Lin Muyun's will,

260
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:07,520
claiming

261
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:09,600
that Lin Muyun left all his shares and assets

262
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,640
to her.

263
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:11,800
Legally,

264
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:13,880
Lin Jiming is completely out.

265
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:17,000
Now the Lin Group is entirely owned by Wen Shiyi.

266
00:13:19,280 --> 00:13:20,360
She's so scary.

267
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:22,720
She can do this to Lin Jiming,

268
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:23,280
she...

269
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,600
she can do this to my brother.

270
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:27,400
But my brother is still foolishly

271
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:28,800
running back to support her.

272
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:30,200
Tian,

273
00:13:30,880 --> 00:13:31,960
what should we do?

274
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,120
She is cleaning up the battlefield,

275
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,880
and also showing off to us.

276
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,560
But she made a mistake.

277
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:40,320
She has pushed everyone to the edge.

278
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:41,360
Yaru,

279
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:43,320
if you want to protect the Liu family,

280
00:13:43,560 --> 00:13:44,600
just relying on defense

281
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:45,600
is not enough.

282
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,560
We must cooperate more thoroughly.

283
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,040
What do you want to do?

284
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:54,680
[This morning,]

285
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:57,280
[the headquarters of Lin Group was crowded with media,]

286
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,320
[and the atmosphere was tense.]

287
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,880
[Many senior executives and shareholders returned in a hurry]

288
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:03,560
[to attend this sudden shareholders' meeting.]

289
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:04,680
[It was announced that]

290
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:07,080
[Mr. Lin Muyun, the founder of Lin Group,]

291
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,360
[has passed away due to illness.]

292
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:09,320
[The group will be]

293
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,440
[taken over by his wife,]

294
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:12,280
[Wen Shiyi, the vice chairman,]

295
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:14,760
[who will take over all duties from his son Lin Jiming.]

296
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:15,800
[At the same time,]

297
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:18,640
[Lin Muyun's will was made public,]

298
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:20,360
[confirming Ms. Wen Shiyi]

299
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:22,560
[as the sole legal heir of the group.]

300
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:23,560
[It is reported that]

301
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:25,160
[Mr. Lin Muyun]

302
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,720
[was known for his foresight.]

303
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,320
Wen Shiyi,

304
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:31,160
do you think you can rest assured

305
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:33,640
by eliminating the heir and forging the will?

306
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:34,800
Have you forgotten

307
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:36,160
that you are not only

308
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:38,320
standing on the ruins of Lin Jiming,

309
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:41,120
but also on the countless mines you buried.

310
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:42,120
Now,

311
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,120
it's my turn

312
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:44,600
to blow them up.
